    "title": "Texas Tech vs Akron time, TV channel: NCAA tournament first round",
    "text": "RED RAIDERS Game time set for Texas Tech vs. Akron in March Madness first round Nathan Giese Lubbock Avalanche-Journal Updated March 15, 2026, 7:46 p.m. CT The Texas Tech basketball team is back in March Madness for the third straight year and will take on Akron in the first round of the NCAA Tournament. The Red Raiders are 22-10 on the season after falling to Iowa State in the quarterfinals of the Big 12 tournament. Akron comes in having won 19 of its last 20 games after winning the MAC tournament championship. Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
